0TB 源码。团队发现移除提前退出分支比保留优化更快，最终在 Apple M4 上实现超 45 GiB/s 吞吐，接近内存带宽。结果已开源为 Rust crate `casefold`，仅实现简单（1 对 1）折叠，与 ripgrep 等工具保持一致。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cms96k3tf05w8ro9kmy0s9bjp","originalUrl":"https://github.blog/engineering/architecture-optimization/dont-stop-early-case-folding-source-code-at-memory-speed","publishedAt":"2026-08-01T00:00:44.798Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1afsx4l","originalSourceName":"GitHub Blog","family":"outlet-1045foe","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cms96k3tf05w8ro9kmy0s9bjp","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-06T14:49:01.513Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1afsx4l","name":"GitHub Blog","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-06T14:49:01.513Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"GitHub 为代码搜索引擎 Blackbird 优化大小写折叠性能，该引擎索引超 1.8 亿个仓库、480TB 源码。团队发现移除提前退出分支比保留优化更快，最终在 Apple M4 上实现超 45 GiB/s 吞吐，接近内存带宽。结果已开源为 Rust crate `casefold`，仅实现简单（1 对 1）折叠，与 ripgrep 等工具保持一致。","reportEdition":"2026-08-01","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cms9ll1s90igcro9ku64ja7db","title":"Thinking Machines 发布开源权重模型 Inkling 与 Inkling-Small 的安全路径","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-08-01T00:00:44.798Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cms9ll1s90igcro9ku64ja7db","https://thinkingmachines.ai/blog/a-safe-path-to-open-weights"],"articles":[{"id":"cms9ll1s90igcro9ku64ja7db","title":"Thinking Machines 发布开源权重模型 Inkling 与 Inkling-Small 的安全路径","originalTitle":"","summary":"Thinking Machines 发布开源权重模型 Inkling 和 Inkling-Small，称安全发布取决于模型本身及生态系统的准备度。公司通过内部评估、四家独立机构外部测试及微调研究验证，认为发布 Inkling 不会在现有开源权重模型基础上增加实质性风险。未来将采取分阶段发布策略，并持续研究危险能力能否与通用智能解耦。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cms9ll1s90igcro9ku64ja7db","originalUrl":"https://thinkingmachines.ai/blog/a-safe-path-to-open-weights","publishedAt":"2026-08-01T00:00:44.798Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-gr15c4","originalSourceName":"Thinking Machines Lab：官方博客（RSS）","family":"outlet-pfg8s6","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cms9ll1s90igcro9ku64ja7db","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-06T14:49:01.513Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-gr15c4","name":"Thinking Machines Lab：官方博客（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-06T14:49:01.513Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"Thinking Machines 发布开源权重模型 Inkling 和 Inkling-Small，称安全发布取决于模型本身及生态系统的准备度。公司通过内部评估、四家独立机构外部测试及微调研究验证，认为发布 Inkling 不会在现有开源权重模型基础上增加实质性风险。未来将采取分阶段发布策略，并持续研究危险能力能否与通用智能解耦。","reportEdition":"2026-08-01","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cms9eics20crbro9kgoo68l7v","title":"Runway Characters 入选 SIGGRAPH 2026 Real-Time Live! 现场演示","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-08-01T00:00:44.798Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cms9eics20crbro9kgoo68l7v","https://runwayml.com/news/company-news/runway-characters-siggraph-2026"],"articles":[{"id":"cms9eics20crbro9kgoo68l7v","title":"Runway Characters 入选 SIGGRAPH 2026 Real-T